1
00:00:09,759 --> 00:00:12,679
(Legend says a loong
dwells in the snowy abyss,)

2
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:15,400
(ruling over the towering peaks)

3
00:00:15,759 --> 00:00:17,600
(and governing the rising tides.)

4
00:00:18,679 --> 00:00:21,160
(Yet divine might
breeds eternal solitude)

5
00:00:21,559 --> 00:00:23,160
(in the vast world.)

6
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:27,719
(The mortal realm
chose the purest maiden)

7
00:00:28,199 --> 00:00:29,879
(to bridge the divide,)

8
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:35,320
(awakening his lonely heart
with mortal warmth.)

9
00:00:36,679 --> 00:00:41,079
(They call it
the greatest divine blessing.)

10
00:00:41,094 --> 00:00:45,864
=My Loong=

11
00:00:46,170 --> 00:00:48,810
=Episode 1=

12
00:01:05,480 --> 00:01:06,640
(My name is Yue Wangshu.)

13
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:10,640
(That year, I was chosen
as the Loong Consort,)

14
00:01:11,159 --> 00:01:13,680
(bestowed the title of princess,
and sent into the Loong Abyss.)

15
00:01:16,840 --> 00:01:19,359
(Everyone speaks
of the Loong Lord's majesty,)

16
00:01:19,879 --> 00:01:21,480
(yet who has ever seen him?)

17
00:01:24,159 --> 00:01:25,159
(The Loong Consort title)

18
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:28,560
(merely throws
a living woman into the abyss.)

19
00:01:30,352 --> 00:01:34,760
(Yue Wangshu, eldest daughter
of the late Guardian General)

20
00:01:34,760 --> 00:01:35,879
My parents died young.

21
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:39,280
(Yue Qiyang, Yue Wangshu's Cousin)
My aunt and cousins coveted our estate,

22
00:01:40,078 --> 00:01:41,617
(Loong God)
and they used this pretext

23
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:44,079
to get rid of me once and for all.

24
00:01:45,422 --> 00:01:46,599
(Zhu Heng, Heir to Prince Qi)

25
00:01:46,599 --> 00:01:47,760
(When he took me to elope,)

26
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:51,680
(I thought I had finally found a home.)

27
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:54,280
(Yet...)

28
00:01:55,239 --> 00:01:57,519
(Heaven and earth as witness,
sun and moon as pledge.)

29
00:01:58,239 --> 00:01:59,239
If you are willing,

30
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:00,560
you shall be my wife.

31
00:02:13,188 --> 00:02:16,009
By order of the General's Manor,
Yue Wangshu beguiled Young Lord Zhu,

32
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:17,960
fled the city,
and must be taken back at once!

33
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:20,319
(Forgive me, Wangshu.)

34
00:02:21,319 --> 00:02:22,319
(As you know,)

35
00:02:22,719 --> 00:02:25,360
your aunt was close friends
with my late mother.

36
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:28,319
She raised me
as my mother entrusted her.

37
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:30,395
(Jiang Liuying, Yue Wangshu's Aunt)
Before my mother passed,

38
00:02:30,395 --> 00:02:33,109
(Yue Lingluo, Yue Wangshu's Cousin)
she betrothed me to your cousin.

39
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:35,759
I cannot betray them.

40
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:37,240
If you cared about that,

41
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:38,479
why did you run away with me?

42
00:02:38,719 --> 00:02:39,960
(I couldn't bear...)

43
00:02:40,319 --> 00:02:43,520
(I couldn't bear to see you sacrificed
to the Loong Lord, so on impulse...)

44
00:02:44,919 --> 00:02:46,879
(At least you can leave
the mortal world behind.)

45
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:51,240
(Yet I must spend my life
with someone I don't love.)

46
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:52,800
(Do you know)

47
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:56,680
my pain is far greater than yours?

48
00:03:28,039 --> 00:03:29,960
My Lady, the aphrodisiac blend is set.

49
00:03:31,319 --> 00:03:32,719
Didn't he pity her?

50
00:03:33,159 --> 00:03:35,719
Let's see just how pure and noble
she really is

51
00:03:36,639 --> 00:03:38,479
or if there really is a Loong Lord.

52
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:40,199
With that little enhancement,

53
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:42,280
if I were her,

54
00:03:42,319 --> 00:03:44,159
I'd pray to die quickly
and spare the misery.

55
00:03:50,919 --> 00:03:53,479
(I'm far enough away.
No one should find out now.)

56
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:48,560
You're going to die anyway.

57
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:50,800
Let me have some fun first.

58
00:05:35,352 --> 00:05:39,927
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

59
00:05:40,702 --> 00:05:45,199
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

60
00:05:48,438 --> 00:05:53,560
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

61
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:56,899
♪A thousand-year trial
scorches the soul♪

62
00:05:56,899 --> 00:05:58,263
♪Refusing to forget♪

63
00:06:01,929 --> 00:06:06,706
♪The mortal world's rules
are cruel and absurd♪

64
00:06:07,257 --> 00:06:09,047
♪He cannot learn them♪

65
00:06:09,047 --> 00:06:12,182
♪Yet carves her name upon his heart♪

66
00:06:15,334 --> 00:06:17,658
♪One name on a wooden plaque♪

67
00:06:17,658 --> 00:06:20,021
♪Swaying high upon the branch♪

68
00:06:20,599 --> 00:06:23,263
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

69
00:06:23,263 --> 00:06:25,021
♪Their days ahead are long♪

70
00:06:55,615 --> 00:07:00,133
(Lizhi, Loong)

71
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:38,920
(Why do I feel her pain?)

72
00:08:34,679 --> 00:08:36,759
It's so cold.

73
00:08:59,559 --> 00:09:01,039
It's so cold.

74
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:52,120
(Legend says a loong
dwells in the snowy abyss,)

75
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:54,840
(ruling over the towering peaks)

76
00:09:55,200 --> 00:09:57,039
(and governing the rising tides.)

77
00:09:58,120 --> 00:10:00,600
(Yet divine might
breeds eternal solitude)

78
00:10:00,879 --> 00:10:02,480
(in the vast world.)

79
00:10:03,399 --> 00:10:07,159
(The mortal realm
chose the purest maiden)

80
00:10:07,639 --> 00:10:09,320
(to bridge the divide,)

81
00:10:09,679 --> 00:10:14,320
(awakening his lonely heart
with mortal warmth.)

82
00:10:14,759 --> 00:10:18,919
(They call it
the greatest divine blessing.)

83
00:10:21,686 --> 00:10:24,093
♪Ten years later,
the street carver opens shop again♪

84
00:10:24,093 --> 00:10:25,773
♪Those two wooden plaques
hang once more♪

85
00:10:25,773 --> 00:10:27,372
♪Someone ties a red string from behind♪

86
00:10:27,372 --> 00:10:29,194
♪Snow falls on shoulders,
growing old together♪

87
00:10:29,194 --> 00:10:30,935
♪The loong's song
leaves a legend in this realm♪

88
00:10:30,935 --> 00:10:32,576
♪Land and rivers as gifts,
wind and snow as adornment♪

89
00:10:32,576 --> 00:10:33,834
♪This time, no sacrifice,
no turning back♪

90
00:10:33,834 --> 00:10:35,747
♪Only with you,
I watch moonset and rising tides♪

91
00:10:35,747 --> 00:10:41,698
♪If fate tears us apart♪

92
00:10:42,202 --> 00:10:47,921
♪I will gamble against heaven itself♪

93
00:10:47,921 --> 00:10:51,523
♪The loong's wrath
shakes mountains and rivers♪

94
00:10:51,523 --> 00:10:55,040
♪Calamity fire
burns away all evil spirits♪

95
00:10:55,059 --> 00:10:58,194
♪You are a drop of blood upon my heart♪

96
00:10:58,194 --> 00:11:01,945
♪I am a wound etched into your palm♪

97
00:11:01,945 --> 00:11:05,419
♪Cloud steps open,
where does the way home lie♪

98
00:11:05,419 --> 00:11:08,680
♪Scattering my divine soul
to gaze upon you for a lifetime♪

99
00:11:09,021 --> 00:11:11,436
♪Wind and snow bear witness,
this heart was not in vain♪

100
00:11:11,910 --> 00:11:14,413
♪With you here♪

101
00:11:14,690 --> 00:11:18,184
♪The loong's wrath
shakes mountains and rivers♪

102
00:11:18,184 --> 00:11:21,084
♪Calamity fire
burns away all evil spirits♪
